/Title (MCF51EM256 Series ColdFire Microcontroller - Data Sheet)
/Author ( Freescale Semiconductor, Inc.)
/Subject (The MCF51EM256/128 series microcontrollers are a member of the ColdFire ? family of reduced instruction set computing \(RISC\) microprocessors. This document provides an overview of these 32-bit microcontrollers. These microcontrollers are systems-on-chips \(SoCs\) that are based on the V1 ColdFire core and the following features: Operating at processor core speeds up to 50.33 MHz, Up to 256 KB of flash memory. Covers: MCF51EM256, MCF51EM128.)
/Keywords (MCF51EM256, MCF51EM128, ColdFire, reduced instruction set computing \(RISC\) , systems-on-chips \(SoCs\), V1 ColdFire core, 50.33 MHz, 256 KB flash memory)
>>
endobj
